Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,千束 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你做了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.77,0:01:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.68,0:01:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.09,0:03:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.70,0:03:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 都在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.62,0:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,受睡眠藥的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.14,0:03:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,可能會疲憊一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.83,0:03:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我被怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,山岸醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那女的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,因瞬時高電壓的過充電
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,現已無法連接硬體了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,已經無法充電了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,卻是最有效的破壞方法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.19,0:03:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.51,0:03:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,還能撐多久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.89,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好剛充過電
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,能撐兩個月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,兩個月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不亂跑還能撐更久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:03:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼兩個月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.85,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,壽命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.19,0:04:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,千束的壽命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,更換壞掉的部分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,辦不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.83,0:04:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但以我們的知識和技術
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.03,0:04:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,無能為力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,千束的人造心臟是孤品
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.60,0:04:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,去解決那個護士
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.55,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼能算了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.27,0:04:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,原本就活不長
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,原本
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,就算殺了她
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,也一切照舊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.99,0:04:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼 不做那個帕菲了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因為瀧奈害臊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我還沒吃過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,點單了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你又來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈要發火了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.91,0:05:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事 顧客至上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.99,0:05:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 我是LycoReco看板娘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真虧你想去DA
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,說是給我什麼東西讓我過去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木好煩人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.01,0:05:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是錢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.11,0:05:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈很在意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,理所當然
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才不想說的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你還是老樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.55,0:06:00.63,Top,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.63,0:06:02.44,Top,,0,0,0,,開得太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼頭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,都快死了還那麼有精神
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,消息真靈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.52,0:06:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以有何貴幹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,回DA吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我快死了 好不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說真島來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,見過兩次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,讓他跑了兩次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.25,0:06:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,也許我是最後一次來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,說點開心的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 給我什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼楠木拿著這個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.66,0:06:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,為阻止情報洩露回收的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我好找
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.91,0:06:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,小偷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.55,0:07:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,最近會組織大規模的真島討伐行動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.09,0:07:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你也參加吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不好笑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.14,0:07:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼多人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.41,0:07:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,為了讓你成為優秀的Lycoris而努力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.60,0:07:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,結果沒盡到職責就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.94,0:07:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我們對職責的認知不一致
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒說完
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.10,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,讓瀧奈回這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣我可考慮一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這個謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,久等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.59,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,然後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.10,0:07:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,小偷自首了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.09,0:07:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.69,0:07:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,帕菲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼樣的都行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,能馬上做好的那種
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂斗也要嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不 馬上就回去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:58.53,Top,,0,0,0,,趕快趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,明日內回復
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是歸復的調令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真島的據點查到了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,攻堅需要人手
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.79,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,開心了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好了走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,行動在三天後
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,老師 告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.27,0:08:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,這就回去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.51,0:08:20.00,Top,,0,0,0,,帕菲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,下次再來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.39,0:08:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,她怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,想回DA應該更開心才對
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,被笨蛋傳染了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 完事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.27,0:08:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好好 知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,那拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.89,0:08:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,身後
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 又讓你跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事 那邊的幾個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.91,0:08:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事沒事 我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.78,0:08:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,這個交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,請別跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.25,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,還吸菸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.55,0:09:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,罪惡感強烈時
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,就想吸兩口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,對懲罰自己來說剛好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.84,0:09:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,吸得那麼難受還是算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我查了一下 你該早點跟我說的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,知道什麼了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,舉世無雙的核桃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.23,0:09:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,現在是沒轍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.69,0:09:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,亞倫機關
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.88,0:09:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,吉松伸二
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,在網路上與其相關的訊息全被刪掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以想直接問問知情者 才沏了這杯難沏的茶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀 這是為了千束
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.55,0:10:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你察覺到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.59,0:10:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,靜音的仁那次
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.59,0:10:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,還有破壞千束心臟的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,其黑幕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是吉松的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那是十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真是吉叔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.67,0:11:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,看來槍是殺不了她了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.22,0:11:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,千束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 千束
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.39,0:11:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有先天性心臟病
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再過半年
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.95,0:11:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,便會死於疾病
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我會阻止的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是亞倫機關的支援孕育的才能結晶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有跳動的完全機械化心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,超越現在的技術數代
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,最實用的產品
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不過並不完備
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,持久性問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:11:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕也只能幫她撐到成年
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lycoris18歲就退役
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,活到那天就夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,殺足夠多的人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,將殺戮的才能獻給世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那是最重要的條件
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.95,0:12:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不會辜負你的期待
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.49,0:12:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你也把千束當成殺人道具嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,何時轉變了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.20,0:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,還在看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀 你擅長照顧孩子嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不擅長
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是經常被孩子們圍著嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那是工作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是腿不好就不做了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望術後你能幫她發揮才能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,DA將會負責…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我在拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她不已經是我們的女兒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,這種任務還是頭一遭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.59,0:13:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不是任務
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是約定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你我間的約定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.62,0:13:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,話有點繞遠了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.33,0:13:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他的為人也是線索
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我和千束的扮家家酒就這樣開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,願意救我的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,認錯了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我是這裡的職工
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.64,0:13:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,騙人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡沒有穿那麼帥西裝的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.81,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:14:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 該道謝的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如何報答你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你有偉大的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,去達成它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,為此 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,結果成了救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,救世主嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.29,0:14:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要成為救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,救世主 笑一個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,老師 我怕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你會健康的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.45,0:15:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.38,0:15:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,慶祝？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,誰送的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是救人的槍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.40,0:15:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,伸二那之後就沒出現過
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.81,0:15:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,也沒見我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,這就是千束不殺人的原因嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真諷刺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.38,0:16:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但為什麼要置千束於死地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.63,0:16:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也許是處理掉不能完成使命的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.60,0:16:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那樣的話護士就當場殺了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.81,0:16:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,追殺我的亞倫也許就是吉松
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,和那天接收武器的真島也有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,思想上也能理解為什麼支援他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到真島就能了解千束的心臟嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都聽見了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是 瑞希也聽了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不用把我賣了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.29,0:16:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,既然抓不到他的蹤跡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,從招搖的真島入手更容易
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.06,0:16:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,能參加DA的行動是個機會
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我本想拒絕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,這不正合你意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.60,0:16:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟千束就剩兩個月了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但我會回DA
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但凡有一絲讓千束活下去的可能性我就去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我給千束說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我自己來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.86,0:17:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,給我時間
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.14,0:17:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼時候來的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她說的吉叔是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是支援她的亞蘭機關的特務
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,果然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Robota 我有計劃了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.71,0:17:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,別吵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.28,0:17:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.27,0:17:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真閒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,歡迎回來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:17:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我有話說
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:17:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,出去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.71,0:18:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,先是這裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.99,0:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,話說你不冷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是千束選的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.57,0:18:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是夏裝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,沒別的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那我來選瀧奈的冬裝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,瀧奈果然是好素材
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,時間到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,轉移吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,還沒選外套
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,沒時間了這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼那麼趕時間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.85,0:19:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.69,0:19:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,人生不如意十之八九
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.12,0:19:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好 瀧奈跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,享受差錯才是千束流
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.71,0:19:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,釣不上啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.08,0:19:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.29,0:19:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只要和你一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.68,0:19:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,時間到了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去了不少地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,再去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,保密
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,都說了該買個外套的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.16,0:19:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,在等什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.02,0:20:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,等雪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,說是9點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,本該是完美的日程
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,神很隨性啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,希望今天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他能認真點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.09,0:20:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.13,0:20:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,因為
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.94,0:20:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,能回DA了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,果然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.11,0:20:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊 什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.39,0:20:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.36,0:20:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.33,0:20:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 確實下雪就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.62,0:20:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,淨是些荒唐事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你不覺得嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因自己無能為力而煩惱也無可奈何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,接受現實盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣基本都會有轉機
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,還有瀧奈的計劃不是大成功嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,今天特別開心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,做得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.39,0:21:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 今天要給DA回復
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,餞別禮 拿走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.76,0:21:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.48,0:23:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,伸二
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,三賀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.79,0:23:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,初次見面
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.59,0:23:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,吉叔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.05,0:22:10.97,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}君が持ってきた漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:13.98,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}くれた知らない名前のお花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:16.60,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今日はまだ来ないかな?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:19.98,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}初めての感情知ってしまった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:25.90,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}窓に飾った絵画をなぞってひとりで宇宙を旅して
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:31.24,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}それだけでいいはずだったのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:37.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君の手を握ってしまったら
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:43.80,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}孤独を知らないこの街には
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:54.56,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}もう二度と帰ってくることはできないのでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:23:05.94,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:11.78,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}歌って聞かせてこの話の続き
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:20.79,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}連れて行って見たことない星まで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.05,0:22:10.97,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,360)\blur7.5}你送我的漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:13.98,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}和不知名的花
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:16.60,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}今天還沒來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:19.98,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}這種感情初次體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.44,0:22:25.90,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在窗上臨摹塗鴉  獨自前往星辰大海
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:31.24,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}我本該心滿意足
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.24,0:22:37.58,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}直到握住你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.92,0:22:43.80,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}在這不懂孤獨的街道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:54.56,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}已經再也回不到從前了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.85,0:23:05.94,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}你伸出了手  光影伴生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:11.78,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}聽我歌唱 聽我訴說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:20.79,ED-CH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur7.5}帶我去未知的星球
